WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.400
MICHEL SZARINDAR: Mark,
what are you doing?

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.710
MARK MIRCHANDANI: I'm trying
to conduct all these workflows,

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.240
but it's so much work to manage.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:06.630
MICHEL SZARINDAR: What?

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:07.780
You do that to yourself?

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.550
You should use Google
